---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-6">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>702 Local ("we," "our," or "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains how we collect and use information through 702o2.com and our associated services.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you fill out inquiry forms for event setups, party rentals, or media bookings, we collect your name, email, phone number, and event date to fulfill your service request.</p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>We use contact details solely to communicate quotes, schedule dates, and coordinate event logistics. We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties.</p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For questions regarding our privacy practices, contact us at <strong>contact@702o2.com</strong>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>